  "segments": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "start_ms": 1980,
      "end_ms": 3180,
      "text": "啊不再看下一个吧"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "start_ms": 4860,
      "end_ms": 5820,
      "text": "学习工作"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "start_ms": 5820,
      "end_ms": 6780,
      "text": "薪资方面的问题"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "start_ms": 6780,
      "end_ms": 7560,
      "text": "掌握技能"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "start_ms": 7560,
      "end_ms": 10020,
      "text": "大学舍友各种机缘巧合下去了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "start_ms": 10020,
      "end_ms": 11640,
      "text": "大平台干公益岗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "start_ms": 11640,
      "end_ms": 13080,
      "text": "据说他没什么具体成长"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "start_ms": 13080,
      "end_ms": 14829,
      "text": "工作待遇非常好"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "start_ms": 14829,
      "end_ms": 17229,
      "text": "产品防水性工艺可靠点"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "start_ms": 17229,
      "end_ms": 20199,
      "text": "用未来潜潜力换现在的待遇"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "start_ms": 20199,
      "end_ms": 22149,
      "text": "本人从技术员什么"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "start_ms": 22149,
      "end_ms": 23229,
      "text": "后来感觉自己不足"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "start_ms": 23229,
      "end_ms": 25080,
      "text": "加上考虑就辞职"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "start_ms": 25080,
      "end_ms": 27720,
      "text": "现在是医疗机械公司干结构工程师"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "start_ms": 27720,
      "end_ms": 29130,
      "text": "干了一年了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "start_ms": 29130,
      "end_ms": 30870,
      "text": "学了很多能力有提升"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "start_ms": 30870,
      "end_ms": 33670,
      "text": "然后那个考核太离谱了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "start_ms": 33670,
      "end_ms": 34510,
      "text": "薪资2000"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "start_ms": 34510,
      "end_ms": 36550,
      "text": "其他都是绩效"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "start_ms": 37400,
      "end_ms": 39580,
      "text": "绩效占了差不多80%"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "start_ms": 39580,
      "end_ms": 44510,
      "text": "学的多的薪资不多哦"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "start_ms": 44510,
      "end_ms": 47210,
      "text": "那他的工资一个月得有1万多的绩效"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "start_ms": 47210,
      "end_ms": 48500,
      "text": "占了80%"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "start_ms": 48500,
      "end_ms": 50330,
      "text": "所以才9000多的工资啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "start_ms": 50330,
      "end_ms": 51320,
      "text": "不错啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "start_ms": 51320,
      "end_ms": 52520,
      "text": "最近离职了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "start_ms": 52520,
      "end_ms": 53780,
      "text": "就觉得制度太离谱"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "start_ms": 53780,
      "end_ms": 54980,
      "text": "投入产出不成比"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "start_ms": 54980,
      "end_ms": 56120,
      "text": "跳槽确实比较稳定"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "start_ms": 56120,
      "end_ms": 59720,
      "text": "是啊你们这个公公司盘剥里面有点夸张啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "start_ms": 59720,
      "end_ms": 63519,
      "text": "给你应该是底薪太低了呀"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "start_ms": 63519,
      "end_ms": 65438,
      "text": "啊也是明年左右离职"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "start_ms": 65438,
      "end_ms": 66759,
      "text": "感觉学的东西还有很多"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "start_ms": 66759,
      "end_ms": 68319,
      "text": "这方面没有沉淀的环境"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 34,
      "start_ms": 68319,
      "end_ms": 69219,
      "text": "突破极限"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 35,
      "start_ms": 69219,
      "end_ms": 71160,
      "text": "看技术走多远"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 36,
      "start_ms": 71160,
      "end_ms": 72780,
      "text": "专根广泛"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 37,
      "start_ms": 72780,
      "end_ms": 74040,
      "text": "根金取个平衡点"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 38,
      "start_ms": 74040,
      "end_ms": 75060,
      "text": "什么时候专精"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 39,
      "start_ms": 75060,
      "end_ms": 76740,
      "text": "什么时候放学"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 40,
      "start_ms": 82660,
      "end_ms": 86680,
      "text": "他是他是干啥的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 41,
      "start_ms": 86680,
      "end_ms": 88660,
      "text": "我再看看结构工程师啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 42,
      "start_ms": 88660,
      "end_ms": 95650,
      "text": "我觉得专精取一个平衡点"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 43,
      "start_ms": 95810,
      "end_ms": 97930,
      "text": "首先你金的那个东西是"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 44,
      "start_ms": 97930,
      "end_ms": 101650,
      "text": "首先你要确定你那个金的那个东西是要放学的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 45,
      "start_ms": 101650,
      "end_ms": 103390,
      "text": "就这个相当于说废话"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 46,
      "start_ms": 103390,
      "end_ms": 107290,
      "text": "就是说你金的那个点是需要各种技术传上去的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 47,
      "start_ms": 107290,
      "end_ms": 108539,
      "text": "明白吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 48,
      "start_ms": 108539,
      "end_ms": 109679,
      "text": "这样来想呗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 49,
      "start_ms": 109679,
      "end_ms": 110309,
      "text": "好吧"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 50,
      "start_ms": 110309,
      "end_ms": 112259,
      "text": "他这个设有公益方向"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 51,
      "start_ms": 112259,
      "end_ms": 113960,
      "text": "专精待遇很好"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 52,
      "start_ms": 113960,
      "end_ms": 119510,
      "text": "专门搞这个防水性供应可靠性这种东西待遇好"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 53,
      "start_ms": 119510,
      "end_ms": 120770,
      "text": "但是是一时的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 54,
      "start_ms": 120770,
      "end_ms": 124500,
      "text": "他这些这些这个明白吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 55,
      "start_ms": 124500,
      "end_ms": 125400,
      "text": "这个是一时的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 56,
      "start_ms": 125400,
      "end_ms": 126420,
      "text": "他没有学习"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 57,
      "start_ms": 127800,
      "end_ms": 131550,
      "text": "然后B试着试着这个范学"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 58,
      "start_ms": 131550,
      "end_ms": 134430,
      "text": "然后最近跳槽了又不精是吧"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 59,
      "start_ms": 134430,
      "end_ms": 135330,
      "text": "一个是精"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 60,
      "start_ms": 135330,
      "end_ms": 137590,
      "text": "一个是饭"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 61,
      "start_ms": 137870,
      "end_ms": 140230,
      "text": "我觉得你还是要追求一个金啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 62,
      "start_ms": 140230,
      "end_ms": 142620,
      "text": "追求一个精"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 63,
      "start_ms": 143380,
      "end_ms": 145020,
      "text": "然后是要追求独家"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 64,
      "start_ms": 146340,
      "end_ms": 147540,
      "text": "追求独家"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 65,
      "start_ms": 147540,
      "end_ms": 149760,
      "text": "追求独家"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 66,
      "start_ms": 150660,
      "end_ms": 154550,
      "text": "就是你你比较专精的这个东西"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 67,
      "start_ms": 154550,
      "end_ms": 158920,
      "text": "它是一个市场的一个突破口啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 68,
      "start_ms": 158920,
      "end_ms": 161680,
      "text": "但是可以抵达你突破口"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 69,
      "start_ms": 161680,
      "end_ms": 164890,
      "text": "他的你通过放学的各种技术基础"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 70,
      "start_ms": 164890,
      "end_ms": 166970,
      "text": "让你确定它可以抵达"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 71,
      "start_ms": 166970,
      "end_ms": 168170,
      "text": "他不是忽悠人的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 72,
      "start_ms": 168170,
      "end_ms": 169310,
      "text": "不是什么固态电池"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 73,
      "start_ms": 169310,
      "end_ms": 170270,
      "text": "固态又固态"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 74,
      "start_ms": 170270,
      "end_ms": 170930,
      "text": "半固态"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 75,
      "start_ms": 170930,
      "end_ms": 171650,
      "text": "半半固态"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 76,
      "start_ms": 171650,
      "end_ms": 173790,
      "text": "固固态固化多少年了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 77,
      "start_ms": 173790,
      "end_ms": 176070,
      "text": "而是说正儿八经的一个是可以抵达的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 78,
      "start_ms": 176070,
      "end_ms": 177750,
      "text": "你自己有一个路线的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 79,
      "start_ms": 177750,
      "end_ms": 180970,
      "text": "你的放学就可以学学到基础知识"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 80,
      "start_ms": 180970,
      "end_ms": 184750,
      "text": "让你能够判断不是专门是用来应用的一种饭"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 81,
      "start_ms": 184750,
      "end_ms": 187480,
      "text": "而是是作为知识基础筑基那种饭"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 82,
      "start_ms": 187480,
      "end_ms": 193360,
      "text": "让你让你能够找到那个可以啊去专精的那种"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 83,
      "start_ms": 193360,
      "end_ms": 194380,
      "text": "专精的那种点"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 84,
      "start_ms": 194380,
      "end_ms": 197200,
      "text": "这些专精点本身也是一个市场的一个"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 85,
      "start_ms": 197200,
      "end_ms": 198440,
      "text": "良好的动向"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 86,
      "start_ms": 198440,
      "end_ms": 200810,
      "text": "你能判断的好吧"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 87,
      "start_ms": 200810,
      "end_ms": 201920,
      "text": "所以不要去"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 88,
      "start_ms": 201920,
      "end_ms": 204080,
      "text": "而且你的问题就是说你不要看你的同事"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 89,
      "start_ms": 204080,
      "end_ms": 206350,
      "text": "ABCD不要看同事"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 90,
      "start_ms": 206350,
      "end_ms": 209590,
      "text": "不要在乎你这同事怎么滴什么大学舍友"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 91,
      "start_ms": 209590,
      "end_ms": 210940,
      "text": "不要在乎这些人"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 92,
      "start_ms": 210940,
      "end_ms": 214149,
      "text": "要看到这个人背后的那个知识技能"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 93,
      "start_ms": 214149,
      "end_ms": 216789,
      "text": "人背后的生产工艺"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 94,
      "start_ms": 216789,
      "end_ms": 220809,
      "text": "还有就是整个市场需求的市场演变的那个方向"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 95,
      "start_ms": 220809,
      "end_ms": 222790,
      "text": "产业发展方向"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 96,
      "start_ms": 222790,
      "end_ms": 228290,
      "text": "A为什么工艺那边能够赚到钱多一点"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 97,
      "start_ms": 228290,
      "end_ms": 228830,
      "text": "怎么怎么的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 98,
      "start_ms": 228830,
      "end_ms": 229790,
      "text": "是因为什么原因"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 99,
      "start_ms": 229790,
      "end_ms": 230570,
      "text": "产品防水性"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 100,
      "start_ms": 230570,
      "end_ms": 231230,
      "text": "工艺可靠性"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 101,
      "start_ms": 231230,
      "end_ms": 233180,
      "text": "他为什么在大平台干这工艺岗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 102,
      "start_ms": 233180,
      "end_ms": 236460,
      "text": "为什么这一类的东西比较注重它的工艺"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 103,
      "start_ms": 236460,
      "end_ms": 237900,
      "text": "注意它表面的工艺"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 104,
      "start_ms": 237900,
      "end_ms": 240900,
      "text": "是不是整个这个行业的技术有瓶颈"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 105,
      "start_ms": 240900,
      "end_ms": 241830,
      "text": "怎么怎么地的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 106,
      "start_ms": 241830,
      "end_ms": 244290,
      "text": "这个瓶颈是一种哪种方向"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 107,
      "start_ms": 244290,
      "end_ms": 246000,
      "text": "就不要简单的把"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 108,
      "start_ms": 246000,
      "end_ms": 249700,
      "text": "不要简单的把一个现象就二元化"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 109,
      "start_ms": 249700,
      "end_ms": 252700,
      "text": "什么砖和精英的一个什么二元对比布"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 110,
      "start_ms": 252700,
      "end_ms": 253660,
      "text": "它背后的是"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 111,
      "start_ms": 253660,
      "end_ms": 257260,
      "text": "更重要的是这个行业的现有的生产方式"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 112,
      "start_ms": 257260,
      "end_ms": 258910,
      "text": "研发方式"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 113,
      "start_ms": 258910,
      "end_ms": 259720,
      "text": "对不对"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 114,
      "start_ms": 259720,
      "end_ms": 261509,
      "text": "还有包括甚至有些啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 115,
      "start_ms": 263849,
      "end_ms": 265289,
      "text": "被哪些还有专利啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 116,
      "start_ms": 265289,
      "end_ms": 267209,
      "text": "是被哪些企业垄断的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 117,
      "start_ms": 267209,
      "end_ms": 269189,
      "text": "那专利能不能绕过资源"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 118,
      "start_ms": 269189,
      "end_ms": 273120,
      "text": "能不能打通牛肝"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 119,
      "start_ms": 273120,
      "end_ms": 276350,
      "text": "不要再想那些人让人不重要"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 120,
      "start_ms": 276350,
      "end_ms": 278660,
      "text": "要把人抽离出那些人"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 121,
      "start_ms": 278660,
      "end_ms": 282200,
      "text": "就看看具体的产业发展脉络方向"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 122,
      "start_ms": 282200,
      "end_ms": 284210,
      "text": "技术成熟的啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 123,
      "start_ms": 284210,
      "end_ms": 286220,
      "text": "一些动向"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 124,
      "start_ms": 286220,
      "end_ms": 289880,
      "text": "要要要善于去发现这些东西"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 125,
      "start_ms": 290100,
      "end_ms": 290600,
      "text": "Ok"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 126,
      "start_ms": 292880,
      "end_ms": 293780,
      "text": "好吧"
